# Profit Statement
| Line Item                || 2024 | 2025 |
| ------------------------ || ---- | ---- |
| [Revenue]                ||      |      |
|   Product Revenue        || 400  | 450  |
|   Service Revenue        || 200  | 240  |
| Revenue Total            || = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",] | = @[Revenue."Product Revenue",2025] + @[Revenue."Service Revenue",2025] |
| [Cost of Sales]          ||      |      |
|   Materials              || 250  | 280  |
|   Fulfillment            || 80   | 95   |
| Cost of Sales Total      || = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,] | = @["Cost of Sales".Materials,2025] + @["Cost of Sales".Fulfillment,2025] |
| Gross Profit             || = @["Revenue Total",] - @["Cost of Sales Total",] | = @["Revenue Total",2025] - @["Cost of Sales Total",2025] |
| Margin Check             || = @["Gross Profit",] == 270 | = @["Gross Profit",2025] == 315 |
